<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Pier 1 Imports Inc as a strong buy and set a 12-month price target of $22 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a fiscal 1997 earnings estimate of $1.25 a share and a fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.48 a share.</p>
<p>-- Pier 1 gained 1/2 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
